{"words": [{"text": "قُلْنَا", "translation": "We said"}, {"text": "ٱهْبِطُوا۟", "translation": "Go down"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "جَمِيعًۭا ۖ", "translation": "all (of you)"}, {"text": "فَإِمَّا", "translation": "and when"}, {"text": "يَأْتِيَنَّكُم", "translation": "comes to you"}, {"text": "مِّنِّى", "translation": "from Me"}, {"text": "هُدًۭى", "translation": "Guidance"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "then whoever"}, {"text": "تَبِعَ", "translation": "follows"}, {"text": "هُدَاىَ", "translation": "My Guidance"}, {"text": "فَلَا", "translation": "[then] no"}, {"text": "خَوْفٌ", "translation": "fear"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "translation": "(will be) on them"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "يَحْزَنُونَ", "translation": "will grieve"}], "sahih": "We said, \"Go down from it, all of you. And when guidance comes to you from Me, whoever follows My guidance - there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve."}